{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4f80049c-ce76-8ed8-9846-45ee9dc2f570",
  "created_at": "2026-01-11T11:57:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carol Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:54:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise. City Hall's closed today, so you've got the weekend line. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:54:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, Carol Brownell. I'm calling about the storm drain out front of my place. I'm on speaker, sorry, I've got flour all over my hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:54:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "111 Admiral Kalbfus Road, up the North End. So the drain right at the curb is gurgling, like wicked loud, and there's this sewer smell coming up out of it. Totally gross. It started during the storm yesterday and it's still doing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:54:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the coastal storm Friday into Saturday. Is there water coming up out of it, or just the noise and the smell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:54:51-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, kind of. Yesterday the water was backing up over the grate and sitting in the road. Today it's down but it's still gurgling, and the smell is in my yard. Hang on, I've got to check my dough. [pause] Okay, it's fine, needs another bit. I'm making sourdough, sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:55:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No apology needed. Has this happened before at that spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:55:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it does it every time it rains hard. Every time. Somebody's supposed to take care of it and it just keeps happening, and I'm tired of calling about it, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:55:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Did you get any photos of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:55:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I took a bunch yesterday, the water over the grate and the puddle in the road. I can send them. Do you have an email or something for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:55:46-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't want to read you the wrong thing over the phone. I'll put a note on the work order that you have photos, and someone from the office will contact you to get them. Is the number you're on a good one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:56:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:56:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0164. Carol Brownell, 111 Admiral Kalbfus Road, storm drain gurgling with a sewer odor, backed up during the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:56:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So are you opening a work order for real? And what date is somebody actually coming? Because last time I just got told someone would look at it and then, nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:56:27-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm opening it right now. Crews are stacked up after a storm like this, so I'd say you're looking at early this week for someone to get out there, probably Monday or Tuesday. I'll mark it as a recurring problem so it doesn't get treated like a one-off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:56:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Monday or Tuesday. Can you at least put that the smell is bad? Because I've got the windows cracked with the oven going and it's coming right in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:56:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note the odor in the report. And if the water starts coming back up over the grate again before then, call this line right back, any hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:57:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will. Hold on one sec, the timer's going. [pause] Sorry. Yeah. I just want it fixed, not looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:57:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I put that in the notes too. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:57:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:57:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Carol. Enjoy the bread."
    }
  ],
